    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Medicago murex</b></i>, the <b>spiny medick</b>, is a plant species of the genus <i>Medicago</i>. It is found throughout the Mediterranean basin. It forms a symbiotic relationship with the bacterium <i>Sinorhizobium medicae</i>, which is capable of nitrogen fixation.",
